{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超出席《全球大學校長及領袖高峰會》致辭時表示，香港擁有5間世界百強大學。在未來五年，特區政府致力將香港建設成為國高端人才集聚高地，其中重點是在北部都會區發展三個大學城。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.675036+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:19:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:38:50.087158+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:38.456588+00:00","content_hash":"ed5447a2db94768d2466459e8fba403c31325a53782020fe4f000b48fbd4a9be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}